Z||000001||88formula||07-15-2000||09:49 PM||||Remove the cigarette lighter cover and put the paper clip in the A and B terminal which is the two upper right one's looking straight at it. When you extract the code don’t just replace the component under that code because something else could cause that circuit to fail.||||reg||5
